                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Folks, this is what abuse of power looks like.\n\n- Trump\u2019s Health Secretary is trying to fire 10,000 healthcare workers.\n- Elon Musk is trying to buy an election in Wisconsin.\n- And the House GOP is trying to undermine the voting rights of millions of Americans and the judicial branch.\n\nSo I say my colleagues: have a backbone, do what is right for the American people, and stand up to this madness.",
