                "retweet_count": 23,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This National Women\u2019s Health Week, we must prioritize the health and well-being of women across NM-01 and the country! From mental health to physical wellness and reproductive care, every woman deserves access to the doctors and resources they need.\u00a0\u00a0\n\nLet\u2019s make a plan to schedule check-ups, talk mental health, and to discuss the issues facing women with our friends and communities! Let's empower each other to live healthier, happier lives!",
