                "retweet_count": 80,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Happy anniversary, Head Start!\u00a0\n\nHead Start was built on a simple but powerful idea: that every child deserves a strong start in life. \n\nIt has given children and families across the U.S. access to early education, health care,\u00a0and food assistance, and currently supports more than 4,000 kids enrolled in Head Start across in New Mexico.\u00a0\n\nWe must continue supporting Head Start, because when we invest in our kids, we invest in our future. \u2764\ufe0f",
