                "text": "We know the GOP\u2019s reconciliation bill will devastate communities across the country. 13.7 million people would lose their health coverage if this bill is enacted.\n\nThe impacts on New Mexicans would be just as devastating. We are using every tool possible to fight back! https://t.co/LqCougj4lW",
