                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Happy 250th Birthday to the United States Postal Service!\n\nFor generations, the USPS has delivered love, hope, medicine, and essential goods all across the country. \n\nIt\u2019s more than about mail\u2014it\u2019s ballots, paychecks, and lifelines.\n\nThat\u2019s why we won\u2019t let Trump and the GOP privatize the USPS for profit and take this vital lifeline away. \n\nHere\u2019s to 250 more years of service and to\nfighting for our future.",
