                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 25,
                "retweet_count": 22,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Every single major medical association in America has denounced conversion \u201ctherapy\u201d for what it is: a cruel, harmful, and unscientific practice that has no place in modern medicine.\u00a0\n\nAs a member of the @EqualityCaucus, I am proud to have joined 186 Members of Congress in calling to uphold state bans on these cruel practices for minors.\u00a0\n\nOur LGBTQ+ community must be loved, seen, and accepted for who they are and nothing less. Period. \u2764\ufe0f\ud83c\udff3\ufe0f\u200d\ud83c\udf08",
                "text_lang": "en",
