                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This #SuicidePreventionWeek, I want to remind everyone that mental health matters, and nobody has to face their challenges alone. It takes courage to ask for help, and every one of us plays a role in creating a community of support and understanding.\n\nHelp is available. Call or text 988 to reach the Suicide and Crisis line. For New Mexicans, you can also call 1-855-NMCRISIS.\n\nIf you or someone you know is struggling, please reach out\u2014help is here, and your life matters.",
