                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Friends\u2014the clock is ticking. There\u2019s no more time for \u201cconcepts of a plan.\u201d It\u2019s time to extend ACA health subsidies before millions lose their healthcare. We\u2019re ready to get a fix across the finish line. Are you? https://t.co/bwRHUgx0HP",
