                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In New Mexico, service is a way of life, and across every community, generations of families have worn the uniform.\u00a0That is why every day we are working to meet the needs of our veterans\u2014from passing the PACT Act, to expanding services for mental health, housing, and transitional services\u2014so every veteran can thrive. \n\nGrateful to appear before the Veterans Affairs Committee yesterday to talk about this commitment to service, right before leaving DC. \ud83d\udc99",
