                "reply_count": 328,
                "retweet_count": 119,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Healthcare is a human right! Every day, we are working to ensure our communities can access the healthcare and support they need\u2014whether that\u2019s access to doctors and nurses, expanding the Indian Health Service, lowering prescription drug costs, or expanding broadband and telehealth.\n\nToday I testified in the Energy & Commerce Committee to help advance our priorities for New Mexico\u2014including healthcare, addiction services, ensuring New Mexicans can heat their homes and stay warm, and addressing the legacy of pollution across tribal lands. We must ensure that our communities have the tools and support they need!",
