                "text": "This is amazing news for our communities across New Mexico. The behavioral health crisis is an issue we must address at every level.\u00a0\n\nEvery day, we are working to expand access to clinics across our district, and I am proud to support a first-of-its-kind regional behavioral hub in Sandoval County and multiple centers in the Albuquerque area. These new clinics will change lives in every community they\u2019re in!",
